<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5458] zepplin can not parse columns correctly which contains chinese character</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5458</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;our workflow&#160; like this zepplin -&amp;gt; livy -&amp;gt; spark on yarn&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;when the result&#160; has chinese character, it can not be shown correctly, just like the picture below&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13030547/13030547_%E6%8D%95%E8%8E%B7.PNG&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;this content is actually supposed to be like this picture below.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13030546/13030546_%E6%8D%95%E8%8E%B71.PNG&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;%C2%A0themethodtoreproduceissue&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#160;the method to reproduce issue&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;put this sql in zeppline web editor:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;select &quot;en&quot;, &quot;hello&quot; union all (select &quot;chinese&quot;,&quot;&#20320;&#22909;&quot;) union all (select &quot;en&quot;, &quot;hello&quot;)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;zepplin version: 0.8.2&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;spark version: 2.4.3&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
